---
import { siteConfig, getFaqItems } from '../../data/siteConfig';
import locations from '../../data/locations.json';

export interface Props {
  city?: string;
}

const { city = siteConfig.warehouseAddress.city } = Astro.props;
const faqItems = getFaqItems(city);
---

<!-- ==============================================
     FAQ SEWA & BELI SCAFFOLDING (COMPACT & MUDAH DIBACA)
=============================================== -->
<section class="py-10 sm:py-14 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200" id="faq">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 font-montserrat">
    <div class="text-center mb-6 sm:mb-9">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 text-xs font-montserrat font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <i class="fas fa-circle-question text-xs"></i>
        <span>Informasi Sewa &amp; Beli Scaffolding</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
        Pertanyaan <span class="text-red-600">Umum (FAQ)</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-roboto">
        Panduan lengkap seputar layanan <strong>sewa scaffolding</strong>, <strong>beli scaffolding baru &amp; second</strong>, sistem COD di proyek, dan pengiriman cepat.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-2.5 sm:space-y-3">
      {faqItems.map((item, index) => (
        <details
          open={index === 0}
          class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3.5 sm:p-4 bg-white shadow-sm hover:border-red-400 group transition-all"
        >
          <summary class="font-semibold text-xs sm:text-base text-slate-900 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
            <span class="pr-3 leading-snug">{item.question}</span>
            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-red-600 text-xs sm:text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 shrink-0"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2.5 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-roboto pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100">
            {item.answer}
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}

      <!-- Panel Otoritas SEO Terlipat Rapi (Zero Dead Scroll di Mobile, 100% Terindeks Mesin Pencari Google) -->
      <details class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3.5 sm:p-4 bg-white/90 shadow-xs hover:border-red-400 group transition-all mt-4">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none select-none">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 pr-3 leading-snug">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-halved text-red-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i>
            <span>Ringkasan Resmi: Pusat Sewa Scaffolding, Beli &amp; Jual Scaffolding Standar SNI ({city})</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-red-600 shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>Detail</span>
            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-[10px] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <article class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed font-roboto space-y-2.5">
          <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            1. Supplier Tangan Pertama Scaffolding / Steger Besi Standar SNI
          </h3>
          <p>
            <strong>Central Scaffolding</strong> adalah pusat penyedia <strong>scaffolding</strong> (perancah besi / steger proyek) dengan gudang fisik dan armada pengiriman sendiri. Seluruh rangka <strong>Main Frame 1,90 meter</strong>, <strong>Main Frame 1,70 meter</strong>, dan <strong>Ladder Frame 0,90 meter</strong> menggunakan pipa baja tebal 1.8–2.0 mm berstandar SNI dan K3 konstruksi.
          </p>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            2. Layanan Sewa Scaffolding Cepat (1–3 Jam Tiba &amp; Bisa Bayar COD)
          </h3>
          <p>
            Bagi kontraktor, mandor, dan pemilik bangunan yang mencari <strong>sewa scaffolding</strong> di {city}, kami menyediakan paket <strong>rental scaffolding</strong> harian maupun bulanan dengan stok 10.000+ set siap kirim hari ini juga. Pembayaran aman karena bisa <strong>COD di lokasi proyek</strong> setelah barang tiba dan diperiksa.
          </p>
          <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            3. Tempat Beli Scaffolding Baru (New) &amp; Beli Scaffolding Bekas (Second)
          </h3>
          <p>
            Selain persewaan, kami melayani pelanggan yang ingin <strong>beli scaffolding</strong> untuk inventaris proyek sendiri. Tersedia pilihan <strong>beli scaffolding baru</strong> langsung pabrik maupun <strong>beli scaffolding second</strong> (bekas rekondisi layak pakai) beserta aksesoris lengkap: <em>Cross Brace 2,20m, Join Pin, Catwalk bordes anti-slip, Tangga Scaffolding (Stairs), Roda Caster Wheel, U-Head Jack,</em> dan <em>Jackbase</em>.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            {locations.map((loc) => (
              <a
                href={`/area/${loc.slug}`}
                class="text-[11px] text-red-700 bg-red-50 hover:bg-red-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium transition-colors"
              >
                Sewa &amp; Beli Scaffolding {loc.cityName}
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </article>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
